  "externalLinksWhitelistHint": {
    "source": "每行一个域名，例如 example.com。仅精确匹配，子域名需单独填写；不要填写协议、路径或端口。",
    "translations": {
      "en": {"text":"One hostname per line, such as example.com. Exact match only; list subdomains separately. Do not include a scheme, path, or port.","sourceRevision":"8f3eb6f4b8033f6c5edb049bca0b59b6ac38d8cb53b836e6ba80a02ad0c03456","reviewed":true},
      "ja": {"text":"1行に1つのホスト名（example.com）。完全一致のみ。サブドメインは個別に指定し、プロトコル・パス・ポートは含めないでください。","sourceRevision":"8f3eb6f4b8033f6c5edb049bca0b59b6ac38d8cb53b836e6ba80a02ad0c03456","reviewed":true},
      "it": {"text":"Un nome host per riga, ad esempio example.com. Corrispondenza esatta; elenca separatamente i sottodomini, senza protocollo, percorso o porta.","sourceRevision":"8f3eb6f4b8033f6c5edb049bca0b59b6ac38d8cb53b836e6ba80a02ad0c03456","reviewed":true},
      "ru": {"text":"Один домен на строку, например example.com. Только точное совпадение; поддомены указывайте отдельно. Не добавляйте схему, путь или порт.","sourceRevision":"8f3eb6f4b8033f6c5edb049bca0b59b6ac38d8cb53b836e6ba80a02ad0c03456","reviewed":true}
